    "rva": "0x1ebbd00",
    "text": "This flag determines whether the character controller refreshes the manifold when checkSupport is called. By default this is set to false, i.e. the manifold is not updated. This leads to a small inaccuracy when the character controller is hit by a rapidly accelerating body, however it is better to accept this inaccuracy, as the extra refresh manifold call can be computationally expensive."
